<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6774678488"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:51.910"><div begin="33.686" end="49.790"><p begin="33.686" end="37.619" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.686" end="34.008">我</span><span begin="34.008" end="34.502">总是</span><span begin="34.502" end="35.537">轻描淡写</span><span begin="35.537" end="36.286">告诉你</span><span begin="36.286" end="37.035">我的愿</span><span begin="37.035" end="37.619">望</span></p><p begin="37.815" end="41.702" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.815" end="38.585">也给你</span><span begin="38.585" end="39.601">千言万语</span><span begin="39.601" end="40.619">都说不尽</span><span begin="40.619" end="41.134">的目</span><span begin="41.134" end="41.702">光</span></p><p begin="41.893" end="45.733" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.893" end="42.647">这世界</span><span begin="42.647" end="43.647">总有人在</span><span begin="43.647" end="44.682">忙忙碌碌</span><span begin="44.682" end="45.165">寻宝</span><span begin="45.165" end="45.733">藏</span></p><p begin="45.939" end="49.790" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.939" end="46.689">却误了</span><span begin="46.689" end="47.505">浮世骄</span><span begin="47.505" end="47.799">阳</span><span begin="47.990" end="48.723">也错过</span><span begin="48.723" end="49.457">人间万</span><span begin="49.457" end="49.790">象</span></p></div><div begin="49.731" end="1:20.165"><p begin="49.731" end="53.018" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.731" end="50.245">古</span><span begin="50.245" end="50.512">城</span><span begin="50.512" end="51.029">里</span> <span begin="51.029" end="51.544">长桥</span><span begin="51.544" end="53.018">上</span></p><p begin="53.745" end="56.809" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.745" end="54.292">人</span><span begin="54.292" end="54.590">如</span><span begin="54.590" end="55.064">海</span> <span begin="55.064" end="55.625">车成</span><span begin="55.625" end="56.809">行</span></p><p begin="57.797" end="1:00.127" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent=